WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.400
This is Jace Morgan.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:08.900
He's fifteen, he's funny, and his phone never leaves his hand.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.600
Jace thinks he's a pretty good person.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.100
His mom thinks he's at the library.

5
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.900
He isn't.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.600
His friend Maya keeps inviting him to youth group.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.900
He keeps laughing it off.

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.900
And the video he posted of Eli?

9
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.800
It's going viral.

10
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.200
Hello?

11
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.450
Where am I?

12
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.750
Where's my phone?

13
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.700
You won't need it, Jace.

14
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.400
Wait… am I… is this…

15
00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.600
Everyone dies once.

16
00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.100
After that comes judgment.

17
00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.900
Every life is recorded.

18
00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.300
Every second.

19
00:01:13.105 --> 00:01:14.600
Is that… me?

20
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:17.300
Mom…

21
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.600
Wait… it recorded everything?

22
00:01:20.805 --> 00:01:21.800
Everything.

23
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.600
Oh no… I was seven…

24
00:01:26.755 --> 00:01:27.750
He'd forgotten.

25
00:01:28.055 --> 00:01:29.150
The record hadn't.

26
00:01:30.285 --> 00:01:31.150
Little things.

27
00:01:31.355 --> 00:01:32.550
Things nobody saw.

28
00:01:51.055 --> 00:01:52.155
I didn't know he…

29
00:01:52.455 --> 00:01:54.015
Every careless word.

30
00:01:54.515 --> 00:01:55.450
Every one.

31
00:01:56.205 --> 00:01:58.250
And the lie he told an hour ago.

32
00:02:06.355 --> 00:02:08.255
It shows what I was thinking?

33
00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.135
He wanted to look away.

34
00:02:18.985 --> 00:02:20.085
It kept playing.
